### ============================================
### TASKS
### ============================================

### Create Task API
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Gym",
  "description": "Task Description",
  "status": "TODO",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2024-06-30T00:00:00.000Z"
}


### Get Current User Tasks API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN


### Get Tasks Grouped By Status API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/tasks/6a879c3acddcd40b5ed833f4/grouped
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN


### Get Tasks With Pagination API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/getPagination/6a879c3acddcd40b5ed833f4?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json


### Get Tasks With Pagination - Page 2
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/getPagination/6a879c3acddcd40b5ed833f4?page=2&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json


### Change Task Status API
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a87aaa3e2fd3c58a684be9b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}


### Update Task API
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/edit/6a87aaa3e2fd3c58a684be9b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Updated Gym Task",
  "description": "Updated Task Description",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "dueDate": "2024-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}